(c) the details on the coverage of the scheme, the funding pattern between States, Centre and Union Territories;
(d) whether the RGSA promotes e-governance and other technology driven solutions to promote good governance in panchayats; and
(e) the steps taken to increase investment in Gram Panchayats infrastructure across the country?

